---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 色彩與字體搭配 Palette & Type
view: made
permalink: /made/palette/
excerpt: 貼上你自己的品牌色號，自動分配角色、延伸輔色與明暗色階，並檢查文字放在每個顏色上清不清楚。
---
<div class="mk-wrap">
<section class="mk-hero">
<div>
<div class="mk-kicker ld"><a class="m-ul" href="/made/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none">MADE</a>　/　PALETTE &amp; TYPE</div>
<h1 class="mk-h1 ld d1">色彩與字體搭配</h1>
</div>
<div class="ld d2">
<p class="mk-lead">貼上你自己的色號，一個也可以。工具會幫你分配主色、輔色和強調色，延伸出搭配色與明暗色階，再把文字放上每一個顏色，告訴你哪些組合清楚、哪些只適合大字。</p>
<p class="mk-note">所有計算都在你的瀏覽器裡完成；用「複製分享連結」就能把這組配色傳給別人。</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="pc" id="pc">
<!-- INPUT -->
<div class="pc-in">
<div class="pc-in-l">
<h2 class="pl-h">YOUR COLORS<small>貼上色號，用空白或逗號分開</small></h2>
<div class="pc-paste"><input class="mk-in" id="pc-text" type="text" placeholder="#12303F, #7CC5E6, E3F1F8" spellcheck="false"><button type="button" class="mk-btn" id="pc-add">加入</button></div>
<div class="pc-chips" id="pc-chips"></div>
<p class="bf-save">最多 6 個。點色塊可以微調，也可以直接用 <label for="pc-pick" class="pc-picklbl">取色器加入</label><input type="color" id="pc-pick" value="#7cc5e6" style="width:0;height:0;opacity:0;border:0;padding:0">。</p>
</div>
<div class="pc-in-r">
<h2 class="pl-h">TYPE<small>字體</small></h2>
<label class="mk-field"><span>標題字體</span><select class="mk-sel" id="pc-hf"></select></label>
<label class="mk-field" style="margin-top: 14px"><span>內文字體</span><select class="mk-sel" id="pc-bf"></select></label>
<label class="mk-field" style="margin-top: 14px"><span>示意標題</span><input class="mk-in" id="pc-ht" type="text" value="讓想法停泊，讓美被看見。"></label>
</div>
</div>

<!-- ROLES -->
<div class="pc-block">
<div class="pc-bh"><h2>ROLES<small>角色分配</small></h2><p>依明度和飽和度自動分配，可以手動改。不夠的角色會從你的顏色延伸出來，標示「延伸」。</p></div>
<div class="pc-roles" id="pc-roles"></div>
<div class="pl-ratio" id="pc-ratio" style="margin-top: 24px"></div>
</div>

<!-- SUGGEST -->
<div class="pc-block">
<div class="pc-bh"><h2>SUPPORTING<small>延伸搭配色</small></h2><p>以主色為基準，依色相關係延伸，保留接近的明度和彩度。點一下可以加入你的配色。</p></div>
<div class="pc-sugs" id="pc-sugs"></div>
</div>

<div class="pc-block">
<div class="pc-bh"><h2>SCALE<small>明暗色階</small></h2><p>每個顏色的 50–900 色階，做按鈕狀態、背景層次或圖表時很好用。點色塊即可複製色號。</p></div>
<div class="pc-scales" id="pc-scales"></div>
</div>

<!-- READABILITY -->
<div class="pc-block">
<div class="pc-bh"><h2>READABILITY<small>文字清不清楚</small></h2><p>把文字放在每個顏色上，依 WCAG 對比標準判斷：內文需要 4.5 以上，大標題需要 3 以上。</p></div>
<div class="pc-read" id="pc-read"></div>
</div>

<!-- PREVIEW -->
<div class="pc-block">
<div class="pc-bh"><h2>PREVIEW<small>套用示意</small></h2><p>用目前的角色分配，套在海報、社群貼文和網頁上看看。</p></div>
<div class="pl-mock">
<div class="pl-poster" id="pl-poster"><div class="dot"></div><span class="k">MEBO DESIGN STUDIO</span><div><p class="t"></p><p class="b"></p></div><div class="ft"><span>2026</span><span>TAIPEI</span></div></div>
<div class="pl-side">
<div class="pl-post" id="pl-post"><p class="t"></p><p class="b"></p></div>
<div class="pl-web" id="pl-web"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="pg"><p class="t"></p><p class="b"></p><span class="btn">了解更多</span></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="pc-block">
<div class="pc-bh"><h2>EXPORT<small>帶走這組配色</small></h2></div>
<div class="pl-out">
<button type="button" class="mk-btn" id="pc-png">下載色票圖 PNG</button>
<button type="button" class="mk-btn ghost" id="pc-hex">複製色號</button>
<button type="button" class="mk-btn ghost" id="pc-css">複製 CSS 變數（含色階）</button>
<button type="button" class="mk-btn ghost" id="pc-link">複製分享連結</button>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</div>
<div class="mk-toast" id="mk-toast" role="status"></div>
<script src="/assets/js/made-palette.js?v={{ build }}" defer></script>
